93
00:03:03,509 --> 00:03:05,313
He was also, colleagues say, very hard to

94
00:03:05,324 --> 00:03:05,726
fool.

95
00:03:06,876 --> 00:03:08,604
Then came 1962.

96
00:03:08,952 --> 00:03:11,604
China's army crossed into India, and India

97
