125
00:04:08,158 --> 00:04:08,919
According to B.

126
00:04:09,571 --> 00:04:11,451
Raman, one of the first of them, several

127
00:04:11,462 --> 00:04:13,147
would go on to lead Indian intelligence

128
00:04:13,158 --> 00:04:13,701
themselves.

129
00:04:14,865 --> 00:04:16,474
Kao's real talent was people.

130
00:04:16,887 --> 00:04:18,637
He recruited beyond the usual police

131
00:04:18,648 --> 00:04:20,659
channels, and built what India had never

132
00:04:20,670 --> 00:04:21,017
had.

133
00:04:21,354 --> 00:04:23,072
There were desks watching each neighbour.

134
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:25,278
There was a technical wing for aerial and

135
00:04:25,289 --> 00:04:27,354
signals intelligence, grown out of

136
00:04:27,354 --> 00:04:27,920
Charbatia.

137
00:04:28,267 --> 00:04:30,072
Later came a small Policy and Research

138
00:04:30,083 --> 00:04:32,137
Staff, which his biographer Nitin Gokhale

139
00:04:32,137 --> 00:04:33,963
calls a forerunner of today's National

140
00:04:33,974 --> 00:04:35,387
