141
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,175
Inside the service, discretion was

142
00:04:38,186 --> 00:04:38,719
everything.

143
00:04:39,790 --> 00:04:41,866
Few of its officers were ever named in

144
00:04:41,877 --> 00:04:42,410
public.

145
00:04:43,394 --> 00:04:44,818
Foreign services noticed.

146
00:04:45,166 --> 00:04:46,590
Former Joint Intelligence Committee

147
00:04:46,601 --> 00:04:47,372
chairman K.N.

148
00:04:47,372 --> 00:04:49,709
Daruwala said Kao's contacts across Asia

149
00:04:50,198 --> 00:04:51,003
